TITLE Albite kinetics with H2S gas, pH 2, 200C
SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH   2 charge
    units mol/kgw
    Fe(3) 0.004
    Fe(2) 0.004
    -water 1

GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 5
    -volume 1
    H2S(g) 5

KINETICS 1
    Albite
        -m0 1
        -m  1
        -parms 1.0 10
        -tol 1e-12
    -steps 10 in 100

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -time true
    -step true
    -totals Si
END
